-- Slice 0022 §A4 step 2: the twelve acquired conditions, transcribed from migrations/0125's own
-- seed straight across into incident_types - no numbers change. risk_model drops
-- treatmentWindowGameDays/treatmentCostKey (now the two real columns beside it); every other key
-- and every probability is copied verbatim.
--
